<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 583.46, up 1.53.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 285 to 277.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.04.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 25,516,580, compared with 18,040,485 Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
